      "playwright": "The awkward input here is the calendar, not the UI. page.clock.setFixedTime pins Date for each weekday without starting the animation clock, which is all the weekday tests need, and the liturgical math is checked through a small window.__rosary hook with date strings, so no timezone guessing is involved. The rosary is SVG, so every bead has a data-testid and 'current' and 'done' are CSS classes the tests read directly without pixel checks. Arrow-key navigation is tested with page.keyboard, which behaves the same under the Pixel 7 touch profile. Persistence writes synchronously, so a reload right after a click is safe with no waiting.",
